#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=SlotMachineC2Test
comment0.text=\r\n\ Pruebas\ unitarias\ de\ los\ metodos\ del\ ciclo\ 2\ de\ SlotMachine\:\ swap,\ lock,\r\n\ unlock,\ spin(wheel,steps)\ y\ spin(setSymbols),\ y\ del\ efecto\ del\ ciclo\ 2\r\n\ sobre\ spin()\ y\ spin(wheel).\ Todas\ se\ ejecutan\ en\ modo\ invisible\ y\ cada\r\n\ caso\ prepara\ lo\ que\ necesita\ (el\ setUp\ solo\ crea\ la\ maquina).\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Sergio\ Gonzalez\ Alba,\ Juan\ Andres\ Alvarez\ Silva\r\n\ @version\ 3.0\r\n
comment1.params=
comment1.target=void\ setUp()
comment10.params=
comment10.target=void\ spinWithStepsShouldAdvanceToTheNextSymbolsInOrder()
comment10.text=\r\n\ Cada\ paso\ avanza\ al\ siguiente\ simbolo\ de\ la\ rueda\ y\ da\ la\ vuelta\ al\ llegar\ al\ final.\r\n
comment11.params=
comment11.target=void\ spinWithStepsShouldLeaveTheSameSymbolAfterAFullTurn()
comment11.text=\r\n\ Una\ vuelta\ completa\ deja\ el\ mismo\ simbolo\ al\ frente.\r\n
comment12.params=
comment12.target=void\ spinWithStepsShouldFailWhenTheWheelIsLocked()
comment12.text=\r\n\ spin\ con\ pasos\ no\ mueve\ una\ rueda\ fija.\r\n
comment13.params=
comment13.target=void\ spinWithStepsShouldFailWhenStepsIsNotPositive()
comment13.text=\r\n\ spin\ con\ pasos\ falla\ si\ los\ pasos\ no\ son\ positivos.\r\n
comment14.params=
comment14.target=void\ spinWithStepsShouldFailWhenTheWheelHasNoSymbols()
comment14.text=\r\n\ spin\ con\ pasos\ falla\ si\ la\ rueda\ no\ tiene\ simbolos.\r\n
comment15.params=
comment15.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldSetTheGivenColors()
comment15.text=\r\n\ spin(setSymbols)\ deja\ los\ colores\ dados\ al\ frente.\r\n
comment16.params=
comment16.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldReuseASymbolTheWheelAlreadyHas()
comment16.text=\r\n\ Si\ la\ rueda\ ya\ tiene\ el\ color,\ solo\ lo\ lleva\ al\ frente\ sin\ duplicarlo.\r\n
comment17.params=
comment17.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldIgnoreLockedWheels()
comment17.text=\r\n\ spin(setSymbols)\ no\ modifica\ ruedas\ fijas.\r\n
comment18.params=
comment18.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldFailWithAColorOutsideTheCatalog()
comment18.text=\r\n\ spin(setSymbols)\ falla\ con\ un\ color\ fuera\ del\ catalogo,\ sin\ afectar\ los\ demas.\r\n
comment19.params=
comment19.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldIgnorePositionsBeyondTheWheelCount()
comment19.text=\r\n\ Las\ posiciones\ sobrantes\ se\ ignoran.\r\n
comment2.params=
comment2.target=void\ swapShouldExchangeTheFrontSymbolsOfTwoWheels()
comment2.text=\r\n\ swap\ intercambia\ los\ simbolos\ al\ frente\ de\ dos\ ruedas.\r\n
comment20.params=
comment20.target=void\ spinWithConfigurationShouldFailWhenTheArrayIsNull()
comment20.text=\r\n\ spin(setSymbols)\ falla\ con\ arreglo\ nulo.\r\n
comment21.params=
comment21.target=void\ spinAllShouldSkipLockedWheels()
comment21.text=\r\n\ spin()\ no\ cambia\ las\ ruedas\ fijas.\r\n
comment22.params=
comment22.target=void\ spinAllShouldSkipWheelsWithoutSymbols()
comment22.text=\r\n\ spin()\ salta\ las\ ruedas\ sin\ simbolos\ sin\ fallar.\r\n
comment3.params=
comment3.target=void\ swapShouldMoveTheLockedStateAlongWithTheWheel()
comment3.text=\r\n\ El\ estado\ fijo\ viaja\ con\ la\ rueda\ al\ intercambiar.\r\n
comment4.params=
comment4.target=void\ swapShouldFailWhenThereAreLessThanTwoWheels()
comment4.text=\r\n\ swap\ falla\ con\ menos\ de\ dos\ ruedas.\r\n
comment5.params=
comment5.target=void\ swapShouldClampPositionsOutOfRange()
comment5.text=\r\n\ swap\ ajusta\ posiciones\ fuera\ de\ rango.\r\n
comment6.params=
comment6.target=void\ lockShouldPreventTheWheelFromSpinning()
comment6.text=\r\n\ Una\ rueda\ fija\ no\ gira.\r\n
comment7.params=
comment7.target=void\ lockShouldFailWhenThereAreNoWheels()
comment7.text=\r\n\ lock\ falla\ si\ no\ hay\ ruedas.\r\n
comment8.params=
comment8.target=void\ unlockShouldAllowTheWheelToSpinAgain()
comment8.text=\r\n\ Al\ soltar\ una\ rueda\ vuelve\ a\ poder\ girar.\r\n
comment9.params=
comment9.target=void\ lockShouldClampPositionsOutOfRange()
comment9.text=\r\n\ lock\ ajusta\ la\ posicion\ 100\ a\ la\ ultima\ rueda.\r\n
